  "scope": "Three-horn common adapter, general carrier fastening and shared structural interface, separate optional Matek power platform. Removable paired servo/input drive remains separate from propulsion/output frame.",
  "intentional_changes": [
    "One common printed adapter with a radial slot accepts the three retained horn profiles; default mixed pair reflects one available original horn. Threaded metal horns use two M1.6x5 screws each. KST uses existing end pilot holes enlarged to 1.5 mm, reverse M1.4x6 screws and front nuts; no manual transfer of new hole centres.",
    "Keep original input shaft, gear planes, shaft-stop floor and separate servo/propulsion modules. Extend slot-end web to 1.5 mm; preserve explicit case, tool and ordered service clearances.",
    "Add rounded generic M2/tie slots to the battery, FC and accessory carriers. Extend the same project structural stack feet to the accessory carrier at a shifted datum; move Mini and its reservations 3 mm local-Y to clear the hardware. Optical tray remains an uninterrupted functional adhesive exception.",
    "Add one optional integral 64x64x35 mm power platform, with two open board bays, common host feet, generic20/30.5 mm square M2 patterns and a local tether tie provision. Export it separately, outside the battery baseline inventory and mass.",
    "One BEC12S-PRO has one output. Exact24 V to8 V main and5.2 V servo uses two boards. BEC+SVPDB alternative uses5 V servos, and battery+SVPDB is also screened. No electrical/thermal or tether-load qualification is claimed.",
    "Propagate per-side horn choice into native geometry, procurement, conditional hardware count, thread/material metadata, mass and motion membership. Unselected optional nut material remains null-density/null-mass rather than inventing a seller alloy.",
    "Audit optional saved CAD, context, STL/STEP, source identities and both optical-host configurations read-only. Include optional artifacts in the gated prototype bundle; preserve their view settings during preview."
  ],
