  "physical_limits": [
    "Fit prototype only. Actual horn seating/spline fit, root concentricity, torque retention, printed fit/strength/creep and reverse-load KST ligament strength remain unmeasured.",
    "Second metal horn blade/axial dimensions remain provisional. KST rear screw head/root gap and actual tools require physical checking; its mounting requires the stated preparation.",
    "Common mechanical interface is project-specific. One platform per unoccupied host; optical and power do not share a host. Direct MG-F10 helix with accessory-host power is excluded; use remote antenna or another screened host.",
    "Finished tie-slot fit depends on strap orientation and printing; do not force a nominal2.5mm strap into an undersized finished throat. No board-specific Matek holes are invented.",
    "Optional power wires/headers, insulation/cooling, input-voltage conflict of the selected FC, current margin, compass interference, tether drop/load/full trajectory and actual prototype wiring remain unresolved.",
    "Printed mass is a BRep-volume/density estimate. Optional power is separate; battery, wiring, antenna and other unmeasured installation items prevent an all-up mass claim."
